<title>UK: Sonatrach raises Dec LPG prices to $330-$305/tonne.</title>
<headline>Sonatrach raises Dec LPG prices to $330-$305/tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian state oil and gas company Sonatrach announced that it has raised its December price for propane to $330 a tonne fob Bethioua and for butane to $305 fob Bethioua.</p>
<p>Prices from Arzew and Skikda will be $7 a tonne above the Bethioua price.</p>
<p>The propane price has increased by $65 a tonne from November, while butane is up by $45 a tonne.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
